    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Blacktop Hustle, a sim-cade where skill, not endless upgrades, decides who wins the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No open-world, jump straight from the garage hub right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it clean with body and wheel colour changes, your driving does the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your car, event and race in point-to-point sprints, circuits, time trials and drags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars stay balanced, victory comes from tight corners, proper braking and aggressive driving.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Blacktop Hustle, a sim-cade where skill, not endless upgrades, decides who wins the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No open-world, jump straight from the garage hub right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it clean with body and wheel colour changes, your driving does the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your car, event and race in point-to-point sprints, circuits, time trials and drags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars stay balanced, victory comes from tight corners, proper braking and aggressive driving.</p>",
